# Trivy ignore list — vulnerabilities that are NOT fixable in this
# repository, with the upstream that owns the fix. The Trivy gate
# (trivy.yml) fails on any remaining fixable HIGH/CRITICAL finding, so
# every entry here must name its blocker and carry a review date.
# Regenerate candidates with:
#   docker run --rm -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \
#     aquasec/trivy image --scanners vuln --severity HIGH,CRITICAL \
#     --ignore-unfixed <image>

# mn2pdf.jar vendors jackson-databind/jackson-core 2.11.3 (2020).
# Upstream: metanorma/mn2pdf must upgrade its bundled jackson.
# Reviewed: 2026-10-01
CVE-2025-52999
