# faraday 2.7.x: fixed in >= 2.14.3, but relaton pins faraday ~> 2.7.0.
# Upstream: relaton must relax its faraday constraint.
# Reviewed: 2026-10-01
CVE-2026-54297

# rubyzip 2.3.x: fixed in >= 3.4.0, but glossarist pins rubyzip >= 2.3, < 3.
# Upstream: glossarist must relax its rubyzip constraint.
# Reviewed: 2026-10-01
CVE-2026-85396

# json 2.18.0 is the default gem bundled with Ruby 4.0.7's stdlib. The
# toolchain lock pins json 2.21.2 in /usr/local/bundle, and every process
# in the image runs under RUBYOPT=-rbundler/setup, which puts the locked
# gem first — the stdlib copy is never loaded. Fixable only by a Ruby
# 4.0.x patch release bundling json >= 2.19.2 (or ~> 2.17.1.2 backport).
# Reviewed: 2026-10-01
CVE-2026-33210
